 "description": "Count how many existing transactions a categorization rule would match, without writing anything, and list the live rules it collides with: a duplicate, a rule that shadows it or that it would shadow, an overlap booking a different account, or a redundant rule booking the same one \u2014 each with how many of the last twelve months' transactions both match and how many this rule would take from the other. Use this to check a rule before creating or applying it. The rule does not have to exist yet.",
